    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Hitman</strong> is a fast-paced, action-packed stealth game that puts you in the shoes of a deadly assassin. Tap to move silently through a high-security desert military base. Sneak behind enemies and execute clean assassinations to rack up kills. Outsmart and outmaneuver enemies while unlocking new skills and rewards to boost your game. How long can you survive the hunt?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/9ac9fad5a0ab5df2ff118c65b03b4b99.poster.avif?t=1737019904\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/9ac9fad5a0ab5df2ff118c65b03b4b99.webm?t=1737019904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/9ac9fad5a0ab5df2ff118c65b03b4b99.mp4?t=1737019904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling stealth gameplay with tactical movement.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/52cb0707cfb5031901e8011550fedf78.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash to unlock unique skins and customize your look.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/aafd1f4c853dbca7a67c5fb2d7ce8119.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn daily rewards and achievements to keep progressing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/1fd1ab99415615cae19288b82465c5fc.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open gacha loot boxes to collect cards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/d3437be2af6440885969c86a990520e3.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble and upgrade cards level<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/1feb5779b5afa4a01eec926b7510b89e.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt or be hunted. Stay sharp, move smart, and keep hunting. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunter Hitman</strong> is a fast-paced, action-packed stealth game that puts you in the shoes of a deadly assassin. Tap to move silently through a high-security desert military base. Sneak behind enemies and execute clean assassinations to rack up kills. Outsmart and outmaneuver enemies while unlocking new skills and rewards to boost your game. How long can you survive the hunt?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/9ac9fad5a0ab5df2ff118c65b03b4b99.poster.avif?t=1737019904\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/9ac9fad5a0ab5df2ff118c65b03b4b99.webm?t=1737019904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/9ac9fad5a0ab5df2ff118c65b03b4b99.mp4?t=1737019904\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thrilling stealth gameplay with tactical movement.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/52cb0707cfb5031901e8011550fedf78.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash to unlock unique skins and customize your look.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/aafd1f4c853dbca7a67c5fb2d7ce8119.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn daily rewards and achievements to keep progressing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/1fd1ab99415615cae19288b82465c5fc.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open gacha loot boxes to collect cards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/d3437be2af6440885969c86a990520e3.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble and upgrade cards level<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397160/extras/1feb5779b5afa4a01eec926b7510b89e.avif?t=1737019904\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt or be hunted. Stay sharp, move smart, and keep hunting. </p>",
